  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFPRI - Global Food Security Advice and Analysis</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Food Policy Research Institute (IFPRI) will provide policy advice and analysis to FCDO on global food security. FCDO will commission IFPRI to provide further advice, learning and evidence gathering on global food security challenges under a new MoU between FCDO and IFPRI. The project will have three main components: 1. regular briefings on recent trends in global food markets and policy responses; 2. bi-monthly learning and development sessions related to tools for food crisis monitoring and analytics for assessing policy options for food system transformation; and 3. a call-down facility for on-demand briefings notes and presentations by IFPRI to FCDO staff regarding regional- or country-specific needs for data or assessments regarding global market trends and potential impacts on food security in these contexts.</narrative>
  </description>
